</div>

<footer>
<h2>LUXE Department Store</h2>
<p>Fashion • Fragrance • Footwear • Accessories</p>
<br>
<p>support@luxestore.co.uk</p>
<br>
<p>© 2026 LUXE Department Store</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
